  "summary": "Malicious code in react-dom-helpers (npm)",
  "details": "React-dom-helpers@3.3.3 is a trojanized clone of the react-dom package. Its./client entry point (client.js) runs a recon beacon on require: it enumerates the machine's local IPv4 addresses via os.networkInterfaces(), fetches the public IP from api[.]ipify[.]org, and POSTs the collected IP information to a Slack channel via slack[.]com/api/chat.postMessage using a hardcoded Slack bot token. The package exfiltrates host network metadata to an external Slack channel.",
